<STYLE ID="5">―We went on along the mountain path, led by </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Chigaya Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, otherwise known as </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">.</STYLE>
