{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">As if the downpour had been a lie, the sky cleared completely, and beautiful moonlight lit up the mountain.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> each carried half of our luggage, which our </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="ぬ">wet</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> clothes had made a little heavier.</STYLE><PG>
