{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">She</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s my new big sister!"</STYLE>
