{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> grabbed </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s arm and pulled her out in front of </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh? Huh? Big sister!?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="13">"Mm... my, my. Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> is my little sister as well. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">, let's sleep together tonight."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Um... I..."</STYLE><PG>
