<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"'Eri-nee'..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="13">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">, shall I give you a piggyback? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">　Someone as little as </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> is no trouble at all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"N-no, I'm fine, thank you..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手前バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"See! </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> likes me better! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Right, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">?"</STYLE>
