<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="13">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> was just holding back for my sake. Right, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> kept glancing our way, asking for help.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Ah, <STYLE ID="13">Chiga-nee</STYLE>! Sorry! Making you come all the way out to get us..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"Mm... heh. If </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> dragged you along, I figured it'd be something like this."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well, no... if anything, it was more like <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE>'s advice, or something..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">'s...?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE> can hear her <STYLE ID="14">dad</STYLE>'s voice. 
{PAUSE ""}
Only in this season, when the cherry blossoms bloom."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
