{STOPSND "SE" "100" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="13">"Huh?"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">The smiles vanished from </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s faces.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\深淵からの呼び声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, isn't that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"Mm... the same as </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Did that mean their </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> had intuition, too?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Hey, hey, is </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> at the Niimura main house, too!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">, I'm sorry. </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> passed away 10 years ago."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> answered with a smile, not looking sad at all.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Oh, I didn't know... Sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">, does your intuition work when you go into dark, narrow places, too?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Dark and narrow...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Mine works when a strong wind hits me."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="13">"Mm... that's different from </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">, then. </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">My mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">'s intuition seems to have worked when she went into dark, narrow places."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">That was certainly completely different from mine.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">It seemed each person had their own conditions.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, is there something about dark, narrow places?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"Mm... I don't know that much... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="16">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> might know."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">But if the </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">person herself</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> was dead, there was no telling whether what </STYLE><STYLE ID="16">Chiga-nee's dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> knew was reliable.</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="13">"Mm... oh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> stopped walking.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
