{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">Maybe there had been a landslide from the heavy rain earlier.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Blocking the mountain path, rocks large and small stood in front of us.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Hey now, we can't get through like this..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"This is a problem... Even going back down to the foot of the mountain would be hard on a path this bad..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
