{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="13">"Mm... there's no way the three of you can get through here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">, go back to the house and tell everyone."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
