<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> climbed the pile of rubble with ease, still carrying the luggage.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Huh? Huh? What was that...! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, that's amazing...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"Mm... when you live in Arata, this is nothing."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"I told you <STYLE ID="3">she</STYLE> was a <STYLE ID="17" RUBY="ましら">monkey</STYLE>, didn't I?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"But climbing that with the luggage takes more than muscle. You'd have to be really good at using your whole body, wouldn't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> can hunt a bear all by herself. She's no ordinary elementary schooler."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Eek...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">Either way, we had to wait here for a while.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Walking was hard in its own way, but sitting still here looked just as hard.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">I lightly brushed off the top of a knee-high rock and sat down.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Its rough, lumpy feel was really unpleasant.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh? There are flowers blooming."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s eyes were on some pale pink flowers.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">The plant was shorter than </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, with its branches spread out like a hydrangea's.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\沈丁花.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="13">"Mm... this is </STYLE><STYLE ID="18" RUBY="じんちょうげ">daphne</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">. The daphne here blooms late."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Daphne blooms from February to March, after all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">If I remember right, in the language of flowers it means―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"Mm... immortality, imperishability, eternity."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Ooh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you know a lot!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> loved this flower."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="15">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s favorite flower, then, had been daphne, not cherry blossoms.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">And, contrary to what daphne means in the language of flowers, </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> had died young.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">How ironic.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
